### ✅ Sprint 3: Tier 6 Fallback Wiring & End-to-End Loop — COMPLETED
* **Goal**: Connect offline Gemma specifically to Tier 5 low-confidence or unmatched tokens.
* **Status**: **Completed & Committed** (`commit 31690d7`).
* **Deliverables Completed**:
